{
  "uid": "hosts-runner-pool",
  "title": "主機 — Runner 池",
  "description": "Runner 池監控（固定對應 product=\"runner-pool\"）：透過中央 pool-status exporter 讀取 canary repo 的 POOL_STATUS_<HOST> 變數，並對照 Windows PC 的 wans-windows 存活狀態。告警規則目前全部為 shadow。排查與 silence 指令見 runbooks/runner-pool-offline.md。",
  "tags": [
    "layer:host",
    "product:runner-pool",
    "provisioned"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "timepicker": {},
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "weekStart": "",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "icon": "doc",
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Runbook：Runner 池告警",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/wanth1997/SkyEye/blob/master/runbooks/runner-pool-offline.md"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "池主機現況",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "各主機狀態總覽（每台一列）",
      "description": "每台預期池主機一列：狀態年齡（嚴格 > 120s 標紅）、state、guard.state、heavy/light 的 busy/slots/queued、可用記憶體（< 2,500 MiB 標紅）、24h 拒絕數、可讀性，以及 pc 對應的 Windows 層 wans-windows 新鮮度與 up 狀態。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 1, "w": 20, "h": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_status_expected)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (time() - pool_status_updated_timestamp_seconds)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (1 * (pool_status_state{state=\"accepting\"} == 1) or 2 * (pool_status_state{state=\"paused\"} == 1) or 3 * (pool_status_state{state=\"held\"} == 1) or 4 * (pool_status_state{state=\"draining\"} == 1))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (1 * (pool_guard_state{state=\"ok\"} == 1) or 2 * (pool_guard_state{state=\"none\"} == 1) or 3 * (pool_guard_state{state=\"paused\"} == 1) or 4 * (pool_guard_state{state=\"killing\"} == 1) or 5 * (pool_guard_state{state=\"held\"} == 1))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_class_busy{class=\"heavy\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_class_slots{class=\"heavy\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "G",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_class_queued{class=\"heavy\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "H",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_class_busy{class=\"light\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "I",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_class_slots{class=\"light\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "J",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_class_queued{class=\"light\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "K",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_guard_avail_bytes)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "L",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_refused_24h)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "M",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (pool_status_readable)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "N",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (host) (label_replace(((up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"} == 1) and (time() - timestamp(up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"}) <= 120)) or ((up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"} == 0) and (time() - timestamp(up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"}) <= 120)) or ((time() - timestamp(up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"}) > 120) * 0 + 2), \"host\", \"pc\", \"\", \"\"))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "joinByField",
          "options": { "byField": "host", "mode": "outer" }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Time 1": true,
              "Time 2": true,
              "Time 3": true,
              "Time 4": true,
              "Time 5": true,
              "Time 6": true,
              "Time 7": true,
              "Time 8": true,
              "Time 9": true,
              "Time 10": true,
              "Time 11": true,
              "Time 12": true,
              "Time 13": true,
              "Time 14": true,
              "Value #A": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "host": 0,
              "Value #B": 1,
              "Value #C": 2,
              "Value #D": 3,
              "Value #E": 4,
              "Value #F": 5,
              "Value #G": 6,
              "Value #H": 7,
              "Value #I": 8,
              "Value #J": 9,
              "Value #K": 10,
              "Value #L": 11,
              "Value #M": 12,
              "Value #N": 13
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "host": "主機",
              "Value #B": "狀態年齡",
              "Value #C": "狀態",
              "Value #D": "Guard",
              "Value #E": "Heavy Busy",
              "Value #F": "Heavy Slots",
              "Value #G": "Heavy Queued",
              "Value #H": "Light Busy",
              "Value #I": "Light Slots",
              "Value #J": "Light Queued",
              "Value #K": "可用記憶體",
              "Value #L": "24h 拒絕",
              "Value #M": "可讀",
              "Value #N": "Windows 層 (wans-windows)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "center" },
          "noValue": "—"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "狀態年齡" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "green", "value": null },
                    { "color": "yellow", "value": 90 },
                    { "color": "red", "value": 120.001 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "狀態" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "1": { "text": "accepting", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                      "2": { "text": "paused", "color": "yellow", "index": 1 },
                      "3": { "text": "held", "color": "red", "index": 2 },
                      "4": { "text": "draining", "color": "orange", "index": 3 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Guard" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "1": { "text": "ok", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                      "2": { "text": "none", "color": "blue", "index": 1 },
                      "3": { "text": "paused", "color": "yellow", "index": 2 },
                      "4": { "text": "killing", "color": "red", "index": 3 },
                      "5": { "text": "held", "color": "red", "index": 4 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "可用記憶體" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "bytes" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 2 },
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "red", "value": null },
                    { "color": "green", "value": 2621440000 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "可讀" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                      "0": { "text": "讀不懂", "color": "red", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Windows 層 (wans-windows)" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "1": { "text": "UP (新鮮)", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                      "0": { "text": "Exporter 失敗", "color": "red", "index": 1 },
                      "2": { "text": "陳舊 (>120s)", "color": "red", "index": 2 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Windows 層 (wans-windows)",
      "description": "依樣本新鮮度（time() - timestamp(up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"}) <= 120s）區分新鮮的 1（Windows 與 Alloy 正常推送）、新鮮的 0（Windows 端 exporter 失敗）、陳舊（>120s，remote_write 停送但尚在 5m lookback 內）或缺樣（無資料）。調查已恢復事件時請對照中斷當時的歷史資料與開機時間，不可只看現在值。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 20, "y": 1, "w": 4, "h": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max(((up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"} == 1) and (time() - timestamp(up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"}) <= 120)) or ((up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"} == 0) and (time() - timestamp(up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"}) <= 120)) or ((time() - timestamp(up{job=\"integrations/windows\",server_id=\"wans-windows\"}) > 120) * 0 + 2))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": { "text": "UP (新鮮)", "color": "green", "index": 0 },
                "0": { "text": "Exporter 失敗", "color": "red", "index": 1 },
                "2": { "text": "陳舊 (>120s)", "color": "red", "index": 2 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2 }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "缺樣 / 無資料"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "告警（product=\"runner-pool\"，含 shadow）",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 8, "w": 24, "h": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Runner 池告警清單（含 shadow，pending 與 firing）",
      "description": "列出所有 product=\"runner-pool\" 的 pending／firing 告警（包含 notification_mode=\"shadow\"），供 S7 shadow 觀察與日常檢視。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 9, "w": 24, "h": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "ALERTS{product=\"runner-pool\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "product": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true,
              "host": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "alertname": "告警",
              "server_id": "主機 (server_id)",
              "alertstate": "狀態",
              "severity": "嚴重度",
              "notification_mode": "通知模式",
              "class": "類別",
              "state": "主機狀態"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "left" },
          "noValue": "目前沒有告警"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "嚴重度" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "High": { "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                      "Medium": { "color": "yellow", "index": 1 },
                      "Low": { "color": "blue", "index": 2 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "狀態" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-background", "mode": "basic" } },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "firing": { "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                      "pending": { "color": "orange", "index": 1 }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "趨勢（心跳、記憶體、Slot 與寫入）",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 15, "w": 24, "h": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "各主機狀態年齡（秒）",
      "description": "time() - pool_status_updated_timestamp_seconds。紅線為 120 秒（離線定義）。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 16, "w": 12, "h": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "time() - pool_status_updated_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 120 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "各主機可用記憶體（參考線：2,500 MiB）",
      "description": "pool_guard_avail_bytes（guard.avail_mb × 1048576）。虛線為 2,500 MiB（2,621,440,000 bytes）參考門檻。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 16, "w": 12, "h": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "pool_guard_avail_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 2621440000 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Slot 使用與排隊（heavy / light）",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 23, "w": 12, "h": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "pool_class_busy",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{class}} busy"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "pool_class_slots",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{class}} slots"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "pool_class_queued",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}} {{class}} queued"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "狀態寫入頻率（每 5 分鐘 seq 變化次數）",
      "description": "changes(pool_status_seq[5m])。每 30 秒寫入一次時正常約為 9–10 次；降到 0 表示 exporter 未觀察到 seq 變化，請先看下方「最後成功讀取距今」排除 exporter 讀取失敗，再判斷主機是否停止寫入。",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 23, "w": 12, "h": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "changes(pool_status_seq[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{host}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
